  <p id="c-chenshu-027-yaocha-family:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-chenshu-027-yaocha-family:p001:m0000" ref="evj_3wb_3l3_****A*AAA">姚察</persName>字<persName id="c-chenshu-027-yaocha-family:p001:m0003" ref="evj_3wb_3l3_****A*AAA">伯審</persName>，吳興武康人也。九世祖<persName id="c-chenshu-027-yaocha-family:p001:m0016" ref="evj_3wb_3l3">信</persName>，吳太常卿，有名江左。</p>
  <p id="c-chenshu-027-yaocha-family:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">梁、陳二史本多是<persName id="c-chenshu-027-yaocha-family:p002:m0008" ref="evj_3wb_3l3_****A*AAA">察</persName>之所撰，其中序論及紀、傳有所闕者，臨亡之時，仍以體例誡約子<persName id="c-chenshu-027-yaocha-family:p002:m0038" ref="evj_3wb_3l3_****A*AAAA">思廉</persName>，博訪撰續，<persName id="c-chenshu-027-yaocha-family:p002:m0046" ref="evj_3wb_3l3_****A*AAAA">思廉</persName>泣涕奉行。</p>
</text>
